# App icons are generated, not authored by hand.
#
# Drop a square source SVG/PNG at the repo root (e.g. app-icon.svg, the
# bespoke per-app icon from STANDARDS §2.6) and run:
#
#     npx tauri icon ./app-icon.svg
#
# That writes 32x32.png, 128x128.png, 128x128@2x.png, icon.icns, icon.ico,
# and the platform mobile/Store icon sets into this directory. They are the
# files referenced by `bundle.icon` in tauri.conf.json. Commit the generated
# icons; they are part of the shippable artifact.
